  url = {https://arnottferels.github.io/concept/north-star/},
  abstract = {This prototype, titled North Star, explores a conceptual design inspired by the star\textquoteright{}s simple yet meaningful shape. The central point, resembling a pseudo-sphere with rays spreading out like evolving sound waves, symbolizes movement, speed, and balance. Using a lattice structure, the design reflects the star\textquoteright{}s natural symmetry along the Z+ and Z- axes, creating a truss-like model that combines strength and elegance.},
